# Cloudflare Pages Cache Rules
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/app-screenshot.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/favicon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
